  "requirement": "Existing requirements input globs MUST continue to select requirements and named examples, excluding named definitions. Definitions referenced by selected texts MUST be captured as separate definition inputs, regardless of whether their names match the glob. Sharing a glob's matching name prefix alone MUST NOT make a definition a dependency.",
  "determination": true,
  "rationale": "Requirements selector resolution explicitly excludes the Term declaration kind. Separate dependency traversal captures referenced terms by exact name. globs_exclude_terms_but_capture_referenced_terms_outside_the_glob verifies both behaviors."
